{"content":[{"c":["LEBAOTH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Town in the Negev of Judah (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.32","r":"Josh.15.32","rawR":"Josh.15.32","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.32","value":"Josh.15.32"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 15:32"},") occupied by the tribe of Simeon under the name Beth-lebaoth (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.19.6","r":"Josh.19.6","rawR":"Josh.19.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.19.6","value":"Josh.19.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"19:6"},"). The parallel list of Simeonite towns has Beth-biri in this place (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.4.31","r":"1Chr.4.31","rawR":"1Chr.4.31","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.4.31","value":"1Chr.4.31"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 4:31"},"). The element ",{"c":["beth"],"sourceClass":"hebrew","t":"span"},{"c":[","],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," “house of,” is undoubtedly original, denoting a place of worship of the goddess of the lions ",{"c":["("],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"},{"c":["lebaoth"],"sourceClass":"hebrew","t":"span"},{"c":[")"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"},"; Beth-biri might be another place or just a textual variant typical of the list in 1 Chronicles."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Lebaoth","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 15:32","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.32","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.32","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.32"},{"anchorText":"19:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.19.6","rawQueryValue":"Josh.19.6","sourceRefExact":"Josh.19.6"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 4:31","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.4.31","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.4.31","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.4.31"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"88be5fe44150698dfc55a6159a2ee4204489a128689d40a07718b0ea9b087415","sourceItemName":"Lebaoth","sourceItemOrder":55,"sourceMember":"Articles/L.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Lebaoth","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Lebaoth","title":"Lebaoth","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}